  "document": "Revenge of the Creature\nRevenge of the Creature (also known as Return of the Creature and Return of the Creature from the Black Lagoon) is the first sequel to \"Creature from the Black Lagoon\", being the only 3-D film released in 1955 and the only 3-D sequel to a 3-D film released during \"the golden age of 3-D\". Directed by Jack Arnold, the film stars John Agar and Lori Nelson. This was Clint Eastwood's film debut."
